      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This was an intentional change, as it gets confusing when avatars have different performance ranks per platform.\n\nIE, a user could filter for Good avatars and a Very Poor would show up since it's \"Good\" on Quest but \"Very Poor\" on PC.  The tile would show a Very Poor icon, thus looking like a broken filter.\n\nI am going to close this post out as it is not a bug, but I would encourage you to make a post in Feature Requests if you feel inclined.",
